{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT<br/>發佈時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：15:38 2026-11-21 HKT</p><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2deeb96b603aca38d09b789715170be4/2026-11/888_20.jpg\"/><p>今（21日）午3時15分，一輛私家車沿北角宏安道行駛，途至福蔭道交界，撞到一名女途人，女子倒臥地上，腳部被右前輪壓住，途人大驚報警，消防接報到場。網上圖片顯示，女事主面朝地伏在地上，多名熱心途人施援，到場消防員蹲下查看車輪壓住腳部情況。</p><p></p><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ce2584552048e222627015f597531d56/2026-11/01_2_17.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1c5dac86d465fbd0a79e385a2a2a9c91/2026-11/02_2_18.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a9d734a4b7a5bf392e3fec7456bbed51/2026-11/03_5_13.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ddbe4e622ea9a584ae8cdbf20e6cfd3f/2026-11/04_3_23.jpg\"/><img alt=\"女途人被車輪壓住腳。fb：車cam L（香港群組）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/702cee82b9a4e31ab280072274636727/2026-11/05_2_9.jpg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T08:03:58.223053+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":201,"images":6,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T07:38:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:27.947531+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:27.947531+00:00","content_hash":"18a61dfd6ef1e0c5e16a3bd9e95c64f722c2833f219b8affd3c5c5968342ffbe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}